{"asset_key":"ep2/herohub_story_12411430","episode":"ep2","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"12411430","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:2:1241143001:1":{"text":"索尼娅，击败死潮舰队，锈锚港恢复平静之后，你有什么计划呢？","source_cn":"索尼娅，击败死潮舰队，锈锚港恢复平静之后，你有什么计划呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9E6E8F4F741BA85D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1241143002:1":{"text":"我不是想打探血薇帮的机密！只是有点好奇，当一切恢复平静，锈锚港之后会怎么样呢？","source_cn":"我不是想打探血薇帮的机密！只是有点好奇，当一切恢复平静...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA0DA81E85B15FA08","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1241143003:1":{"text":"……锈锚港在这次封锁中元气大伤，我会着手恢复锈锚港的贸易运输，让民生尽快恢复。","source_cn":"……锈锚港在这次封锁中元气大伤，我会着手恢复锈锚港的贸...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xED5BDEA910143DE8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1241143004:1":{"text":"那么锈锚港的民风问题……","source_cn":"那么锈锚港的民风问题……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6608C6A31480EF63","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1241143005:1":{"text":"那是我们的生活方式。","source_cn":"那是我们的生活方式。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC459146F3B3BB546","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn"